including not complete cross-platform portability of the samtools code,
samtools changing rapidly at the time I did this, and not really sure
that the best strategy is to blindly pull the data in to R -- maybe
better, at least for some applications, would be to aim further down
stream, e.g., coverage.

Please feel free, Kasper or others out there, to work on this; I'm happy
to offer my two cents.

